  "question": "g(x) = ax² + 24. For the function g defined above, a is a constant and g(4) = 8. What is the value of g(−4)?",
  "choices": {
    "A": "8",
    "B": "0",
    "C": "−1",
    "D": "−8"
  },
  "answer": "A",
  "explanation": "16a + 24 = 8 gives a = −1. g(−4) = −16 + 24 = 8 (g is even, so g(−4) = g(4)).",
